KG42.register("clusters-9603682fd6fba294cb1df976",{"id":"29-smart_home_trading::v142-d-CL003","paper":"29-smart_home_trading","label":"Prosumers may delegate resource management to an aggregator","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-CL003","label":"Prosumers may delegate resource management to an aggregator","market_meaning":"In the general resource-management discussion of household P2P trading, prosumers may use aggregator services to manage resources, and prosumers themselves need not directly control all loads and energy. This permission itself does not specify that the aggregator is the ECO-Trade central processing center.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M01"],"market_types":["LEM"],"process_stages":["participation"],"scope_disposition":"compatible","scope_explanation":"Only the optional resource-management delegation in the introduction is retained. The source text also discusses the possibility of centralized or distributed infrastructure, does not stipulate aggregator delegation as a precondition for algorithm participation, and does not confirm that the aggregator and the central processing center are the same entity.","assembly_status":"assembled","boundary_rationale":"The optional resource-management delegation has independent entity, activity, and permission meanings; lacking a basis for equating the entities and responsibilities, it is not merged with the centralized computation responsibility and is not expanded into a market access condition.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R005","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Retains the independent permission for prosumers to use aggregator resource-management services and does not rewrite it as a necessary obligation."}],"connections":[],"object_mappings":[],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-CL003-G001","category":"unverified_source","description":"This permission is supported only by introduction evidence, and the B status remains unverified; the existing records contain no specific delegation terms or aggregator responsibility allocation, and the candidate assembly does not mean these contents have been independently audited.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R005"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E02"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually check the original scope of this general permission; if association with algorithm coordination responsibilities is required later, separately supplement source basis for the same entity or an explicit responsibility interface."}]},"rule_refs":["29-smart_home_trading::v141-c-R005"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["COMP-4f53e496ef066050"]});
